<div class="grid" id="cards">
<article class="card" data-category="coast" data-search="goa beach coast sunset fort food"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512343879784-a960bf40e7f2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Goa coastline"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Coast & sunshine</div><h3>Goa</h3><p>Golden beaches, colourful lanes, local food and sunsets that ask you to slow down.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>WEST INDIA</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Goa')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
<article class="card" data-category="heritage" data-search="jaipur rajasthan heritage palace culture hawa mahal forts"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599661046827-dacff0c0f09a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Jaipur palace architecture"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Culture & heritage</div><h3>Jaipur</h3><p>Pink-hued streets, historic forts, lively bazaars and royal stories.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>RAJASTHAN</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Jaipur')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
<article class="card" data-category="mountain" data-search="manali himachal mountains snow adventure pine forest"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1626621341517-bbf3d9990a23?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Himalayan mountain scenery"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Mountains & adventure</div><h3>Manali</h3><p>Fresh mountain air, winding roads, pine forests and Himalayan views.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>HIMACHAL PRADESH</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Manali')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
<article class="card" data-category="nature" data-search="kerala backwaters nature greenery houseboat alleppey munnar"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1602216056096-3b40cc0c9944?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Kerala backwaters"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Nature & slow travel</div><h3>Kerala</h3><p>Peaceful backwaters, green landscapes, hill country and local flavours.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>SOUTH INDIA</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Kerala')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
<article class="card" data-category="heritage" data-search="udaipur lakes rajasthan architecture city palace culture"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1477587458883-47145ed94245?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Udaipur lakeside architecture"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">Lakes & old-world charm</div><h3>Udaipur</h3><p>Lake views, beautiful architecture, boat rides and memorable evenings.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>RAJASTHAN</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Udaipur')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
<article class="card" data-category="nature" data-search="rishikesh river yoga uttarakhand nature rafting"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500534623283-312aade485b7?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="River and mountain landscape"><div class="card-body"><div class="tag">River & reset</div><h3>Rishikesh</h3><p>Riverside views, peaceful moments and a lively Himalayan gateway.</p><div class="card-foot"><span>UTTARAKHAND</span><button class="textlink" onclick="showDestination('Rishikesh')">Explore details ↗</button></div></div></article>
</div>
</div></section>

<section class="planner" id="planner"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Make it happen</div><h2>Sketch your escape.</h2></div><p>A quick budget estimate to help you start planning. Change the numbers to explore different trip ideas.</p></div>
<div class="planner-box"><div><div class="quote">Less scrolling.<br>More <span>exploring.</span></div><p class="note">This is an illustrative estimate, not a live travel quote. Transport, stays, tickets and seasonal prices may change the final cost.</p></div>
<div class="planner-form"><label for="destination">Destination</label><select id="destination"><option>Goa</option><option>Jaipur</option><option>Manali</option><option>Kerala</option><option>Udaipur</option><option>Rishikesh</option></select><label for="people">Number of travellers</label><input id="people" type="number" min="1" max="20" value="2"><label for="days">Trip length (days)</label><input id="days" type="number" min="1" max="60" value="3"><label for="daily">Estimated spend per person / day (₹)</label><input id="daily" type="number" min="0" value="2500"><button class="btn primary" onclick="calculate()">Calculate estimate</button><div class="estimate" id="estimate">₹15,000</div><div class="note" id="estimateNote">Estimated total for your group.</div><button class="btn secondary" style="margin-top:15px;color:white;border-color:#dce5df" onclick="prepareTrip()">Create trip summary</button><div id="tripSummary" class="note" aria-live="polite"></div></div></div></div></section>

<section class="detail-section" id="map"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="kicker">Find your way</div><h2>Explore on the map.</h2></div><p>Open a destination in Google Maps to view its location, nearby attractions and directions. Map links open Google Maps; live route planning happens there.</p></div>
<div class="detail-grid">
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Goa</h3><p>Explore beaches, Panaji and Old Goa.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Goa+India">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Jaipur</h3><p>Find Hawa Mahal, Amber Fort and the old city.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jaipur+Rajasthan">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Manali</h3><p>View the town, mountain scenery and nearby places.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Manali+Himachal+Pradesh">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Kerala</h3><p>Explore backwaters, Munnar and coastal areas.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kerala+India">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Udaipur</h3><p>Find Lake Pichola, City Palace and the old town.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Udaipur+Rajasthan">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
<div class="detail-tile"><h3>📍 Rishikesh</h3><p>View the Ganges riverfront and nearby attractions.</p><p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="textlink" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Rishikesh+Uttarakhand">Open map ↗</a></p></div>
</div></div></section>

<section id="about" class="about-band"><div class="wrap"><div class="kicker">A little about us</div><h2>The world is bigger<br>than your usual route.</h2><p>OUTOFLANE is a travel discovery project for curious explorers. Our goal is to make it easier to find inspiration, compare ideas and plan thoughtful journeys. Destination information and budget figures on this demo site are starting points—always confirm local conditions, opening times and prices before travelling.</p></div></section>

